[{"client_msg_id":"a57093aa-e4d5-4815-a016-f32e52a4cfe9","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"今なら `completeslash` もあるしなぁ（あ、まだ自分では使ってなかった）","ts":"1620277215.111000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fBiCd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f6474541-3420-420b-a780-ad56fccebd47","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"理由全く思い出せなくなりつつあるけど何故か初手からLinuxに篭って使っていた","ts":"1620271520.109600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5R8J"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ca862fdc-b0db-4450-a02f-4c5fa8230014","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"そういえばWindows上でちゃんとViｍ使ったことないな・・・\nなんか突発的にデータ整形したいときとかにKaoriyaVim使うくらいだった。プラグインとかも入れたことない。","ts":"1620271182.109400","edited":{"user":"U7B4ZD49X","ts":"1620271375.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eF0V"}]},{"client_msg_id":"65a244b4-f861-491b-b6a0-4d082fafdea6","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"いまmsys由来のパス変換あるし、Vim側で頑張る意味が薄まったんですよね。","ts":"1620271094.108100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KPi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e2bd8c39-28c7-48e1-9b24-d57a0f310b44","type":"message","user":"U7HFY4HFY","text":"てかこのページmacやLinuxでも無意味に `set shellslash` してるし書いてる人も意味わかってない説ある","ts":"1620271041.107200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"totemoturai","count":2,"users":["U776661HA","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L82+6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6fd62664-28ce-4965-b555-cfed7ef49290","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"っていうかちょくちょくそういうのがあった。","ts":"1620271041.107100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Q//"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c929b8b2-f4eb-43d4-a057-8d13c6daa5c2","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"昔はmsysじゃないtcsh使ってて、そいつがshellslashとの相性良かったんですよ。","ts":"1620271032.106800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U7HFY4HFY"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DCu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a27bf8ab-eafb-45b6-8ece-8f97dd40f3c9","type":"message","user":"U7HFY4HFY","text":"僕が昔shellslashオンにしてたのたぶん\u003chttps://texwiki.texjp.org/?Vim-LaTeX|Vim-LaTeXのwiki\u003eにそう書いてあったからだと思うけど、オンにしなくても普通に動くし壊れるプラグインが多いからやめた","ts":"1620270950.105600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k16"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0e0ee322-0fb2-4337-b4e8-226f3fe379e9","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"（って話は Docs に書いてあっても良いか）","ts":"1620270776.104200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bJM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"35e3c269-9655-4d3c-8167-778fc8548172","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"shellslash で動かないプラグインが多すぎて、頑張ってサポートしても、どうせみんな最後は shellslash やめるでしょ？という気持ち","ts":"1620270740.103900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"f3GM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d687a207-0246-4574-a686-44dc0c234a37","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"正直サポートコストが見合わないと思うんですよね...","ts":"1620270703.103200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"x+9m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3e6fc049-18b3-4d3e-8b3d-80fd87847838","type":"message","user":"U7HFY4HFY","text":"shellslash使わない方が良いと思ってる","ts":"1620270668.102500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uEG02"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dc3475a0-2469-453a-835c-115c7b2b326a","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/lambdalisue/fern.vim/issues/102\u003e\n\nはい、サポートしてないです","ts":"1620270618.102100","thread_ts":"1620270618.102100","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: Feature request: Support 'shellslash' on Windows · Issue #102 · lambdalisue/fern.vim","id":1,"title":"Feature request: Support 'shellslash' on Windows · Issue #102 · lambdalisue/fern.vim","title_link":"https://github.com/lambdalisue/fern.vim/issues/102","text":"When the shellslah option is set on Windows Fern does not work and an error message like fern: {base} (\"C:/TEMP\") must be an absolute path is returned.","image_url":"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/66d6a5f0af3b36004c3a21945109320b5d2f02673c1ad6db002703c00aaa9ca8/lambdalisue/fern.vim/issues/102","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","from_url":"https://github.com/lambdalisue/fern.vim/issues/102","original_url":"https://github.com/lambdalisue/fern.vim/issues/102"}],"reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5dJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"79e14d23-12be-416c-890d-12db340ca8f3","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/akakyouryuu/status/1390116826269437953\u003e","ts":"1620270191.101600","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/akakyouryuu|@akakyouryuu\u003e: VimのファイラーでFern よさげだと思ったらshellslash設定していると使えない","id":1,"author_name":"赤恐竜","author_subname":"@akakyouryuu","author_link":"https://twitter.com/akakyouryuu/status/1390116826269437953","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/588641048659787776/3yuuPH-C_normal.png","text":"VimのファイラーでFern よさげだと思ったらshellslash設定していると使えない","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1620264653,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/akakyouryuu/status/1390116826269437953","original_url":"https://twitter.com/akakyouryuu/status/1390116826269437953"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nDB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"65e5166d-2ab5-46d7-a6fe-4ff219296c19","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"coc-kite ですが coc-kite/package.json の \"activationEvents\" が `onLanguage:python` のため、python以外のファイルタイプでは拡張が有効にならないようです。\n\n```  \"activationEvents\": [\n    \"onLanguage:python\"\n  ],```","ts":"1620259912.100900","thread_ts":"1620139463.089600","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oNL"}],"root":{"type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"やっぱりcoc-kiteだとpythonだけに絞られてた。意外と他もあるぞ・・・有効にしてみよう","ts":"1620139463.089600","thread_ts":"1620139463.089600","reply_count":2,"files":[{"id":"F020USRJ7DY","created":1620139438,"timestamp":1620139438,"name":"2021-05-04_23-43.png","title":"2021-05-04_23-43.png","mimetype":"image/png","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"png","pretty_type":"PNG","user":"U7B4ZD49X","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":47257,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F020USRJ7DY/2021-05-04_23-43.png","url_private_download":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F020USRJ7DY/download/2021-05-04_23-43.png","original_h":685,"original_w":438,"thumb_64":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F020USRJ7DY-96c906e27d/2021-05-04_23-43_64.png","thumb_80":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F020USRJ7DY-96c906e27d/2021-05-04_23-43_80.png","thumb_160":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F020USRJ7DY-96c906e27d/2021-05-04_23-43_160.png","thumb_360":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F020USRJ7DY-96c906e27d/2021-05-04_23-43_360.png","thumb_360_gif":"","thumb_360_w":230,"thumb_360_h":360,"thumb_480":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F020USRJ7DY